[00:00.00] 作曲 : Ella Langley/Jordan Schmidt/Smith Ahnquist/Michael Hardy
[00:00.00][by:波罗猫与海鸥心]
[00:12.09]She drinks wine by the glass, not by the bottle
[00:12.09]她浅酌美酒 从不贪杯
[00:16.97]She ain't stuck on the past, ain't worried about tomorrow
[00:16.97]不困于过往 不忧于明日
[00:21.31]She's a lover, a mother, a sister, and wife
[00:21.31]她是爱人 是母亲 是姐妹 是妻子
[00:25.37]She rolls over in the morning to the love of her life
[00:25.37]清晨转身 拥入挚爱怀抱
[00:29.76]Only smokes one on vacation, says just what she thinks
[00:29.76]只在假期轻抽一支 直言心事
[00:34.34]She don't need validation or much of anything
[00:34.34]无需旁人认可 也不奢求太多
[00:38.52]
[00:39.02]I just wanna be her so bad, it hurts so bad, it hurts so
[00:39.02]我多想成为她 满心渴望 痛彻心扉
[00:43.25]I just wanna be her, I just wanna be her
[00:43.25]我多想成为她 只想成为她
[00:47.59]I just wanna be her so bad, it hurts so bad, it hurts so
[00:47.59]我多想成为她 满心渴望 痛彻心扉
[00:52.00]I just wanna be her, I just wanna be her so bad
[00:52.00]我多想成为她 渴望到极致
[00:59.51]It hurts so bad
[00:59.51]心痛到无法呼吸
